>>> (wrap.initializer_lists.policy=chop_always) Chop always with the preset.
class Point {
  Point(this.x, this.y) : _len = sqrt(x * x + y * y), _label = '$x,$y';
}
<<<
class Point {
  Point(this.x, this.y)
    : _len = sqrt(x * x + y * y),
      _label = '$x,$y';
}
>>> A short list stays inline.
